      <description><![CDATA[<ul><li>saltAMP updates itself: it checks once a day and asks before installing.</li><li>The name is saltAMP (was saltSES), with the speaker mark as its logo.</li><li>Settings: Language (English, Nederlands, Türkçe) and About (privacy, licences).</li><li>Backups are saved whole or not at all, and never over an earlier one.</li><li>The page says when it is reading the speakers, and when it lost contact.</li></ul>]]></description>
